Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 41/76] V.3 block 3 test-only PLE fault injection
 (VLLM_PLE_TEST_FAULT): one-shot rank-selective cuts at serving ordinal N for
 exceptions before/after prepare, inside/after release, park before publish,
 dropped request, blocked input completion, launch park/partial/silent READY;
 disarmed = single None checks outside compiled/captured regions (Sol draft,
 Fable applied/tested)

Apply notes: model_runner hunk headers lacked context and were applied by hand (same content); test fixture used a Mock request that msgpack cannot encode, replaced with a real PleOffloadRequest. exc_async_output deliberately unhooked: under PP2 the PLE owner (PP0) never produces AsyncOutput (last PP stage).

Tests: tests/v1/ple_offload/test_test_fault.py 24 passed. Full suite deferred until the running decab2 A/B finishes.
